// Single source of truth for the release version (SDK + ExampleApp).
//
// Change VERSION_NAME here when preparing a release (deploy/vX.Y.Z). Every ExampleApp build
// configuration sets MARKETING_VERSION = $(VERSION_NAME), so do not edit the "Version" field in
// Xcode's General tab: that writes a literal MARKETING_VERSION and bypasses this file.
// fastlane's `verify_release` lane fails the pipeline if the two disagree.
VERSION_NAME = 4.10.0
